# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in real values. Loaded automatically by
# cmd/server on startup (godotenv), read via the ORIVA__ env-var prefix
# ("__" separates config nesting: ORIVA__JUDGE__OPENROUTER__API_KEY ->
# judge.openrouter.api_key). Absent entirely -> the OpenRouter judge is
# skipped and scoring falls back to the local Ollama judge (judge.ollama.*
# in config/dev.yaml, no key needed).

ORIVA__JUDGE__OPENROUTER__API_KEY=
